---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Support — Trypup" description="Need help with the Trypup app? Email us at support@trypup.life." lang="en" alt="/podpora/">
  <section class="section wrap prose">
    <h1>Support</h1>
    <p class="meta">Have a question or something not working? Reach out — we're happy to help.</p>

    <p>Need help with the app, ran into a bug, or not sure how to care for your dog in Trypup? Drop us a line.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Support:</strong> <a href="mailto:support@trypup.life">support@trypup.life</a></li>
    </ul>
    <p>To help us route you faster, please include your <strong>phone model</strong>, <strong>OS</strong> (iOS / Android) and <strong>app version</strong> (found at the bottom of Settings) in your email.</p>

    <h2>Frequently asked</h2>

    <h3>How does Trypup work?</h3>
    <p>You pick a breed, name your dog and care for it like the real thing — walks, feeding, training, vet. More in <a href="/en/#how-it-works">How it works</a> or on the <a href="/en/about/">About</a> page.</p>

    <h3>How do I delete my account and data?</h3>
    <p>Right in the app: <strong>Account → Delete account</strong>. If you've already uninstalled the app, email support and we'll delete your data. Details: <a href="/en/delete-account/">Delete account</a>.</p>

    <h3>Subscriptions and payments</h3>
    <p>Your subscription (Premium) is managed by the App Store or Google Play — you can cancel it there anytime. For anything else about payments, contact support.</p>

    <h3>What about my privacy?</h3>
    <p>The app works without an account and we process data only as needed. See our <a href="/en/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> for details.</p>

    <p>Didn't find your answer? <a href="mailto:support@trypup.life">Email us at support@trypup.life</a> — we're here for you.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
